--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. CIF has no third-party runtime or build dependencies beyond a C++20
standard library, the platform's socket and file APIs, and CMake plus a C++
compiler to build it. Everything else -- the SHA-256 and CRC-32C
implementations, the canonical codec, the framed transport, the persistence
layer, the test harness and the benchmarks -- is implemented in this
repository.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Telemetry
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

CIF transmits no telemetry. It opens sockets only when it is explicitly asked
to listen or to connect, and those sockets carry nothing but the CIF wire
protocol. Nothing in this project contacts a network service on its own.
